  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Olketa eksampol blong kod, JSON Skema, an template blong polisi wea masin save readim, oli gat laesens aninit long MIT Laesens, sapos i no gat narafala stetmen. Yu save deployim olketa long sait blong yu seleva, fri nomoa.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Ples Blong Statim Raet Wea Oli Joenim Tugeta",
