  "Commercial use requires contact": "Yusum Blong Bisnes I Nidim Yu Kontaktem Mifala",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Oli askim blong mekem hem afta long Bletchley AI Safety Summit, an Yoshua Bengio i lidim hem witim moa long 100 ekspat wea oli kontribiutim, wea oli kamaot long samwe 30 kantri, plas UN, OECD an EU, indipenden ripot ia i putum tugeta olketa saentifik evidens distaem abaotem kapabiliti an risik blong frontia AI — an i talemaot sei samfala sistem distaem save luksavem taem oli evaluetim olketa, an save jenisim beheivia blong olketa akoding long hemia.",
