  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Tanem olketa stetmen blong raet i kam wan maket blong laesensing wea save wok trufala, no jas wan Wep wea i open o klosum nomoa.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kopiim Finis ✓",
  "Copy": "Kopiim",
  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Stret Fasin Blong Poziten: indipenden risej draft, propozol blong protokol, an wan eksperiment blong open spesifikesen.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Fiksim wan defolt bifo: Belgium (BE) distaem i go witim Dach lanwis, i no French — pipol wea oli tok Flemish, oli mek moa (samwe 60%) long kantri ia, winim pipol wea oli tok Walloon French (samwe 40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Fiksim wan defolt bifo: Kazakhstan (KZ) distaem i go witim Kazakh lanwis, i no Rusen, naoia we wan translesen long Kazakh i stap finis — semfala kaen fiks olsem fiks blong Belgium bifo.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
  "Crawler access rules": "Olketa Rul Blong Akses Blong Crawler",
